{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/3c4e873262734b0fbb5591aa30e6fcf0","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/3c4e873262734b0fbb5591aa30e6fcf0","content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eOur Queenstown branch has been operating since August 2021. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/i1qg3clq/the-eastern-cape-11.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003eFor decades, Roadlab has served clients in the Eastern Cape from our Mthatha and East London branches\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eToday, clients operating in and around Queenstown have even greater access to Roadlab\u0027s expert material testing and laboratory services.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMagrietta, Pieter and Mike have been operating our latest branch the country in Queenstown since September 2021.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGot questions? You can reach our Queenstown branch at 082 415 8808 or by leaving an enquiry below.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
